    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just a \"mistake\" though. a mistake is a typo or being late to a meeting. what i did... it left a permanent mark on people. i see their faces every time i close my eyes. i feel like i've become a parasite. like, if i'm still here, i'm just occupying space that could be used for someone actually good. i don't see how \"growth\" changes the fact that i've done something irredeemable.",
